      "number": 2,
      "title": "Reject a negative quantity in a stock line",
      "body": "A stock line with a negative quantity, for example `A1,bolt,-2,0.25`, loads without an error, and the total comes out lower than the real stock value. In our stock files a negative quantity is always a typing error.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] `parse_line` raises `ValueError` for a line whose quantity is negative, and the message contains `quantity must not be negative`.\n- [ ] A quantity of 0 is still accepted.\n",
